{"id":72183,"date":"2026-11-01T19:22:01","date_gmt":"2026-11-01T19:22:01","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72183"},"modified":"2026-11-01T21:59:49","modified_gmt":"2026-11-01T20:59:49","slug":"sao-silvestre-salamanca","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-salamanca\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre Salamanca 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Salamanca 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Salamanca 2026<\/strong> (oficialmente <strong>41\u00aa Vuelta Popular San Silvestre Salmantina<\/strong>) realiza-se na manh\u00e3 de domingo, <strong>27 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, na cidade monumental de <strong>Salamanca, Espanha<\/strong>. Muito procurada por atletas portugueses devido \u00e0 proximidade com a fronteira da Beira Interior e Tr\u00e1s-os-Montes, esta hist\u00f3rica S\u00e3o Silvestre espanhola \u00e9 organizada pelo <strong>Club Deportivo Padre Basabe<\/strong> (Colegio San Estanislao de Kostka) com o patroc\u00ednio do <strong>Ayuntamiento de Salamanca<\/strong> e re\u00fane um limite emblem\u00e1tico de <strong>7.007 dorsais<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com todas as partidas e chegadas instaladas no <strong>Paseo de San Antonio<\/strong>, o programa matinal divide-se em quatro percursos oficiais por escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios: \u00e0s <strong>11:30<\/strong> parte o <strong>Percurso A (1070 m)<\/strong> para Sub-10; \u00e0s <strong>11:50<\/strong> o <strong>Percurso B (1500 m)<\/strong> para Sub-12; e \u00e0s <strong>12:10<\/strong> o <strong>Percurso C (2250 m)<\/strong> para Sub-14 e Sub-16. \u00c0s <strong>12:30<\/strong> \u00e9 dado o tiro de partida para a prova rainha, o <strong>Percurso D de 10 km (10 000 metros)<\/strong> para atletas de Sub-18 a Seniores e Veteranos, num tra\u00e7ado \u00fanico que atravessa os monumentos Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO \u2014 incluindo a <strong>Plaza Mayor, a Puente Romano, a Casa de las Conchas, a Universidade e as Catedrais de Salamanca<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A prova distingue-se pelo seu forte ambiente festivo \u2014 com pr\u00e9mios para clubes, equipas e concursos culturais \u2014 e pela sua voca\u00e7\u00e3o social atrav\u00e9s do projeto <strong>\u00abChip Solidario\u00bb<\/strong>, que apoia institui\u00e7\u00f5es locais sem fins lucrativos, al\u00e9m de atribuir trof\u00e9us artesanais produzidos pelos utentes da <strong>ASPACE Salamanca<\/strong>. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">27 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Salamanca, Espanha<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-